  "job_B1.8.2_20251001_193258": {
    "chunk_text": "l\u00e6t his Se m\u00e6ssepreost sceal mannum bodian \u00feone so\u00fean geleafan and hym larspel secgan. And \u00fea seocan geneosian. And cild fullian, swa ra\u00fee swa man ra\u00feost m\u00e6ge hi geradian to fulluhte. Gif se seoca man gyrna\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man hine smyrige, he do \u00feonne anddetnysse \u00e6r \u00fe\u00e6re smyrunge. And gif he eft gewyrp\u00f0 \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6re smyrunge, he mot wifes brucan and fl\u00e6sces, gif he wile. On \u00fe\u00e6re smyrunge bi\u00f0 synna forgifennys, him to beterunge, and ne bi\u00f0 na hadung. And gif he eft seoc bi\u00f0, hine man eft smyrige. Sume preostas f\u00e6gnie\u00f0, \u00feonne men for\u00f0fara\u00f0 and gegaderia\u00f0 hy to \u00feam lice, swaswa gr\u00e6dige Ac hym gebyra\u00f0 to bestandenne \u00fea men, \u00fee gehyra\u00f0 to his hyrnysse into his mynstre. And he ne sceal na faran on o\u00feres folgo\u00fee to nanum lice, butan he gela\u00feod sy. Ne mot nan preost beon mangere o\u00fe\u00fee gerefa. Ne drincan \u00e6t wynhuse, ne druncengeorn beon. Ne modig, ne gylpende, ne on his gyrlum ranc, ne mid golde geglenged ac mid godum \u00feeawum. Ne he sacful ne beo. Ne he ceaste ne astyrige. Ac he sceal \u00fea sacfullan gesibbian, gif he m\u00e6g. Ne mot he w\u00e6pnu werian ne to gefeohte faran. For\u00feon\u00fee se canon us segd: gif he ofslagen bi\u00f0 on folces gefeohte o\u00fe\u00fee for sumere ceaste, \u00fe\u00e6t man Nu secga\u00f0 sume preostas, \u00fe\u00e6t Petrus h\u00e6fde sweord",
